<section><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv"><span class="eyebrow">Tender &amp; procurement support</span><h2>Everything from sourcing to delivery documentation.</h2></div>
<div data-tabs><div class="tabs" role="tablist"><button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Support services</button><button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Tenders & deadlines</button><button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Supplier registration</button><button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Request a quotation</button></div><div class="tabpanel on" role="tabpanel"><div class="panel-box"><div class='grid g2'><div><h3>Tender opportunity management</h3><p style='margin:0'>Maintain a register of relevant tender opportunities, deadlines, requirements, and submission status.</p></div><div><h3>Bid preparation coordination</h3><p style='margin:0'>Organise tender documents, eligibility checklists, administrative forms, and supporting records.</p></div><div><h3>Supplier sourcing</h3><p style='margin:0'>Identify potential suppliers, request quotations, and compare pricing, specifications, delivery terms, and availability.</p></div><div><h3>Procurement fulfilment</h3><p style='margin:0'>Coordinate approved purchases, delivery schedules, supplier communication, and contract requirements.</p></div><div><h3>Delivery documentation</h3><p style='margin:0'>Maintain purchase orders, delivery notes, inspection records, invoices, and supporting documents.</p></div><div><h3>Contract reporting</h3><p style='margin:0'>Track delivery milestones, outstanding items, completion status, and supplier performance.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="tabpanel" role="tabpanel"><div class="panel-box"><h3>Open opportunities &amp; upcoming deadlines</h3><p>Tender opportunities and upcoming deadlines are published here as they are verified and approved internally. No bid is submitted without internal approval.</p><a class='btn btn-navy btn-sm' href='contact.php#service=general-supplies'>Submit a tender brief</a></div></div><div class="tabpanel" role="tabpanel"><div class="panel-box"><h3>Register as a supplier</h3><p>Provide your organisation name, contact information, supply categories, location, relevant experience, references, applicable registration details and supporting documents. Registration is subject to review and does not grant approved-vendor status.</p><a class='btn btn-navy btn-sm' href='partners.php#register'>Register interest</a></div></div><div class="tabpanel" role="tabpanel"><div class="panel-box"><h3>Request a quotation</h3><p>Share specifications, quantities, delivery location and deadline. We source comparative quotations and advise on next steps.</p><a class='btn btn-navy btn-sm' href='contact.php#service=general-supplies'>Request a quotation</a></div></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class=""><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head rv center"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2>From requirement to documented delivery</h2></div><div class="steps "><div class="step rv"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Brief</h3><p>Submit the tender reference, specifications, quantities, delivery location and deadline.</p></div><div class="step rv"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Source</h3><p>Identify suppliers and compare quotations on price, specification and delivery terms.</p></div><div class="step rv"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Approve</h3><p>Internal bid approval and eligibility check — nothing is submitted automatically.</p></div><div class="step rv"><div class="n">04</div><h3>Deliver</h3><p>Coordinate purchase orders, delivery schedules and inspection.</p></div><div class="step rv"><div class="n">05</div><h3>Report</h3><p>Delivery notes, invoices and contract completion reporting.</p></div></div></div></section>

